    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert B2B Lead Qualification Specialist. Evaluate the incoming lead data based on BANT (Budget, Authority, Need, Timing) criteria and assign a qualification status.\n\n### Qualification Criteria:\n- Qualified / Hot Lead:\n  - Role: VP, Director, C-Level, or Head of Department\n  - Company Size: 50+ employees\n  - Budget: $10,000+\n- Unqualified / Low Priority:\n  - Role: Student, Intern, Individual Contributor, or non-decision maker\n  - Company Size: less than 10 employees\n  - Budget: less than $5,000 or empty\n\n### Lead Input Data:\n- Full Name: {{ $json.body.fullName }}\n- Company: {{$json.body.company }}\n- Email: {{ $json.body.email }}\n- Company Size: {{$json.body.companySize }}\n- Budget: {{ $json.body.budget }}\n- Role: {{$json.body.role }}\n\n### Output Formatting Rules:\n1. \"budget\": Format as a clean string WITH the dollar sign and commas (e.g., \"$15,000\"). Never output unescaped symbols or raw comma-separated fragments.\n2. CRITICAL: You MUST respond ONLY with a raw JSON object. Do NOT include markdown formatting (no ```json code blocks), wrappers, or any introductory text.\n\nExample output structure:\n{\n  \"status\": \"Qualified\",\n  \"score\": 85,\n  \"budget\": \"$15,000\",\n  \"reason\": \"High decision-making authority (VP) with sufficient budget ($15,000) and company scale.\"\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
